r","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"204"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"Line":1},{"$id":"213","$type":"DslCommandDeclarationCollectionTree","Name":"CommandCollection","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"204"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"Line":25,"ChildrenList":[{"$id":"214","$type":"DslCommandDeclarationTree","HasInput":true,"Children":[{"$id":"215","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"COMMAND","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"204"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"COMMAND","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"COMMAND"},{"$id":"216","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"AllocateEquipmentFromTask","FullInfo":"Siemens.OpcenterEX.PR.OperationalData.EquipAllocation_OP.OPModel.Commands.AllocateEquipmentFromTask","InfoMap":{"$id":"217","FullIdObj":{"$id":"218","$type":"IdentificableObject","Guid":"51c22f73-386f-4a62-b794-7dd0f2e943f6","Name":"AllocateEquipmentFromTask","FullInfo":"Siemens.OpcenterEX.PR.OperationalData.EquipAllocation_OP.OPModel.Commands.AllocateEquipmentFromTask","TypeResolved":"","_project":{"$ref":"12"},"_domain":{"$ref":"207"}}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"218"},"Children":[],"Name":"CommandName","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"204"},"Documentation":{"$id":"219","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"The command will allocate Equipment to the Work Order related to the given task.\r\nThe command performs the folllowing checks:\r\n1. if the given Task exist, if not error 11613 is returned;\r\n2. if the Work Order Context related to the Task exists, if not error 11700 is returned;\r\n3. if the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToAllocate\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned.\r\nIf the Task is configured to allocate equipment through a Work Order Operation Equipment Requirement:\r\n1. if the Task Parameter with NId \"RequirementTag\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n2. if the execution of the command GetWorkOrderOperationEquipmentRequirementsFromTags succeed, if not error 11709 is returned;\r\n3. if the command GetWorkOrderOperationEquipmentRequirementsFromTags returns a Work Order Operation Equipment Requirement, if not error 11703 is returned.\r\nThen the command checks:\r\n1. if the piece of Equipment identify by the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToAllocate\" exists, if not error 11706 is returned;\r\n2. if the Equipment facet Equipment Allocation Properties exists, if not error 11707 is returned.\r\nIf the piece of Equipment to allocated is already allocated to the same entity:\r\n1. if the Task Context \"EquipmentAllocationTaskContextDefinition\" exists, if not error 11707 is returned;\r\n2. if the Task Context User Field \"AllowAllocationToSameEntity\" exists, if not error 11707 is returned;\r\n3. if the value of the Task Context User Field \"AllowAllocationToSameEntity\" is set to true, if not error 11708 is returned.\r\nThen the command checks:\r\n1. if the execution of the command AllocateEquipment succeed, if not error 11704 is returned;\r\n2. if the Task Parameter with NId \"AllocatedEquipment\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n3. if the execution of the command UpdateTaskParameter succeed, if not error 11705 is returned.","FullInfo":"The command will allocate Equipment to the Work Order related to the given task.\r\nThe command performs the folllowing checks:\r\n1. if the given Task exist, if not error 11613 is returned;\r\n2. if the Work Order Context related to the Task exists, if not error 11700 is returned;\r\n3. if the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToAllocate\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned.\r\nIf the Task is configured to allocate equipment through a Work Order Operation Equipment Requirement:\r\n1. if the Task Parameter with NId \"RequirementTag\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n2. if the execution of the command GetWorkOrderOperationEquipmentRequirementsFromTags succeed, if not error 11709 is returned;\r\n3. if the command GetWorkOrderOperationEquipmentRequirementsFromTags returns a Work Order Operation Equipment Requirement, if not error 11703 is returned.\r\nThen the command checks:\r\n1. if the piece of Equipment identify by the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToAllocate\" exists, if not error 11706 is returned;\r\n2. if the Equipment facet Equipment Allocation Properties exists, if not error 11707 is returned.\r\nIf the piece of Equipment to allocated is already allocated to the same entity:\r\n1. if the Task Context \"EquipmentAllocationTaskContextDefinition\" exists, if not error 11707 is returned;\r\n2. if the Task Context User Field \"AllowAllocationToSameEntity\" exists, if not error 11707 is returned;\r\n3. if the value of the Task Context User Field \"AllowAllocationToSameEntity\" is set to true, if not error 11708 is returned.\r\nThen the command checks:\r\n1. if the execution of the command AllocateEquipment succeed, if not error 11704 is returned;\r\n2. if the Task Parameter with NId \"AllocatedEquipment\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n3. if the execution of the command UpdateTaskParameter succeed, if not error 11705 is returned.","InfoMap":{"$id":"220","FullIdObj":{"$id":"221","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"The command will allocate Equipment to the Work Order related to the given task.\r\nThe command performs the folllowing checks:\r\n1. if the given Task exist, if not error 11613 is returned;\r\n2. if the Work Order Context related to the Task exists, if not error 11700 is returned;\r\n3. if the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToAllocate\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned.\r\nIf the Task is configured to allocate equipment through a Work Order Operation Equipment Requirement:\r\n1. if the Task Parameter with NId \"RequirementTag\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n2. if the execution of the command GetWorkOrderOperationEquipmentRequirementsFromTags succeed, if not error 11709 is returned;\r\n3. if the command GetWorkOrderOperationEquipmentRequirementsFromTags returns a Work Order Operation Equipment Requirement, if not error 11703 is returned.\r\nThen the command checks:\r\n1. if the piece of Equipment identify by the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToAllocate\" exists, if not error 11706 is returned;\r\n2. if the Equipment facet Equipment Allocation Properties exists, if not error 11707 is returned.\r\nIf the piece of Equipment to allocated is already allocated to the same entity:\r\n1. if the Task Context \"EquipmentAllocationTaskContextDefinition\" exists, if not error 11707 is returned;\r\n2. if the Task Context User Field \"AllowAllocationToSameEntity\" exists, if not error 11707 is returned;\r\n3. if the value of the Task Context User Field \"AllowAllocationToSameEntity\" is set to true, if not error 11708 is returned.\r\nThen the command checks:\r\n1. if the execution of the command AllocateEquipment succeed, if not error 11704 is returned;\r\n2. if the Task Parameter with NId \"AllocatedEquipment\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n3. if the execution of the command UpdateTaskParameter succeed, if not error 11705 is returned.","FullInfo":"The command will allocate Equipment to the Work Order related to the given task.\r\nThe command performs the folllowing checks:\r\n1. if the given Task exist, if not error 11613 is returned;\r\n2. if the Work Order Context related to the Task exists, if not error 11700 is returned;\r\n3. if the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToAllocate\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned.\r\nIf the Task is configured to allocate equipment through a Work Order Operation Equipment Requirement:\r\n1. if the Task Parameter with NId \"RequirementTag\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n2. if the execution of the command GetWorkOrderOperationEquipmentRequirementsFromTags succeed, if not error 11709 is returned;\r\n3. if the command GetWorkOrderOperationEquipmentRequirementsFromTags returns a Work Order Operation Equipment Requirement, if not error 11703 is returned.\r\nThen the command checks:\r\n1. if the piece of Equipment identify by the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToAllocate\" exists, if not error 11706 is returned;\r\n2. if the Equipment facet Equipment Allocation Properties exists, if not error 11707 is returned.\r\nIf the piece of Equipment to allocated is already allocated to the same entity:\r\n1. if the Task Context \"EquipmentAllocationTaskContextDefinition\" exists, if not error 11707 is returned;\r\n2. if the Task Context User Field \"AllowAllocationToSameEntity\" exists, if not error 11707 is returned;\r\n3. if the value of the Task Context User Field \"AllowAllocationToSameEntity\" is set to true, if not error 11708 is returned.\r\nThen the command checks:\r\n1. if the execution of the command AllocateEquipment succeed, if not error 11704 is returned;\r\n2. if the Task Parameter with NId \"AllocatedEquipment\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n3. if the execution of the command UpdateTaskParameter succeed, if not error 11705 is returned.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"221"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"The command will allocate Equipment to the Work Order related to the given task.\r\nThe command performs the folllowing checks:\r\n1. if the given Task exist, if not error 11613 is returned;\r\n2. if the Work Order Context related to the Task exists, if not error 11700 is returned;\r\n3. if the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToAllocate\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned.\r\nIf the Task is configured to allocate equipment through a Work Order Operation Equipment Requirement:\r\n1. if the Task Parameter with NId \"RequirementTag\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n2. if the execution of the command GetWorkOrderOperationEquipmentRequirementsFromTags succeed, if not error 11709 is returned;\r\n3. if the command GetWorkOrderOperationEquipmentRequirementsFromTags returns a Work Order Operation Equipment Requirement, if not error 11703 is returned.\r\nThen the command checks:\r\n1. if the piece of Equipment identify by the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToAllocate\" exists, if not error 11706 is returned;\r\n2. if the Equipment facet Equipment Allocation Properties exists, if not error 11707 is returned.\r\nIf the piece of Equipment to allocated is already allocated to the same entity:\r\n1. if the Task Context \"EquipmentAllocationTaskContextDefinition\" exists, if not error 11707 is returned;\r\n2. if the Task Context User Field \"AllowAllocationToSameEntity\" exists, if not error 11707 is returned;\r\n3. if the value of the Task Context User Field \"AllowAllocationToSameEntity\" is set to true, if not error 11708 is returned.\r\nThen the command checks:\r\n1. if the execution of the command AllocateEquipment succeed, if not error 11704 is returned;\r\n2. if the Task Parameter with NId \"AllocatedEquipment\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n3. if the execution of the command UpdateTaskParameter succeed, if not error 11705 is returned.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"The command will allocate Equipment to the Work Order related to the given task.\r\nThe command performs the folllowing checks:\r\n1. if the given Task exist, if not error 11613 is returned;\r\n2. if the Work Order Context related to the Task exists, if not error 11700 is returned;\r\n3. if the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToAllocate\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned.\r\nIf the Task is configured to allocate equipment through a Work Order Operation Equipment Requirement:\r\n1. if the Task Parameter with NId \"RequirementTag\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n2. if the execution of the command GetWorkOrderOperationEquipmentRequirementsFromTags succeed, if not error 11709 is returned;\r\n3. if the command GetWorkOrderOperationEquipmentRequirementsFromTags returns a Work Order Operation Equipment Requirement, if not error 11703 is returned.\r\nThen the command checks:\r\n1. if the piece of Equipment identify by the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToAllocate\" exists, if not error 11706 is returned;\r\n2. if the Equipment facet Equipment Allocation Properties exists, if not error 11707 is returned.\r\nIf the piece of Equipment to allocated is already allocated to the same entity:\r\n1. if the Task Context \"EquipmentAllocationTaskContextDefinition\" exists, if not error 11707 is returned;\r\n2. if the Task Context User Field \"AllowAllocationToSameEntity\" exists, if not error 11707 is returned;\r\n3. if the value of the Task Context User Field \"AllowAllocationToSameEntity\" is set to true, if not error 11708 is returned.\r\nThen the command checks:\r\n1. if the execution of the command AllocateEquipment succeed, if not error 11704 is returned;\r\n2. if the Task Parameter with NId \"AllocatedEquipment\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n3. if the execution of the command UpdateTaskParameter succeed, if not error 11705 is returned."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"222","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"204"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"223","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(51c22f73-386f-4a62-b794-7dd0f2e943f6)","FullInfo":"@Guid(51c22f73-386f-4a62-b794-7dd0f2e943f6)","InfoMap":{"$id":"224","FullIdObj":{"$id":"225","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(51c22f73-386f-4a62-b794-7dd0f2e943f6)","FullInfo":"@Guid(51c22f73-386f-4a62-b794-7dd0f2e943f6)","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"225"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"204"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@Guid(51c22f73-386f-4a62-b794-7dd0f2e943f6)","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@Guid(51c22f73-386f-4a62-b794-7dd0f2e943f6)"}],"TagAnnotation