a.EquipAllocation_OP.OPModel.Commands.ReleaseEquipmentFromTask","InfoMap":{"$id":"390","FullIdObj":{"$id":"391","$type":"IdentificableObject","Guid":"9c3e877e-fb58-462c-a4e4-6d820cb3d7e2","Name":"ReleaseEquipmentFromTask","FullInfo":"Siemens.OpcenterEX.PR.OperationalData.EquipAllocation_OP.OPModel.Commands.ReleaseEquipmentFromTask","TypeResolved":"","_project":{"$ref":"12"},"_domain":{"$ref":"207"}}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"391"},"Children":[],"Name":"CommandName","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"204"},"Documentation":{"$id":"392","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"The command will release the allocated Equipment related to this task.\r\nThe command performs the folllowing checks:\r\n1. if the given Task exist, if not error 11613 is returned;\r\n2. if the Work Order Context related to the Task exists, if not error 11700 is returned;\r\n3. if the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n4. if the value of the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" is not empty, if not error 11711 is returned;\r\n5. if the piece of Equipment identify by the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" exists, if not error 11706 is returned;\r\n6. if the execution of the command ReleaseEquipment succeed, if not error 11710 is returned;\r\n7. if the Task Parameter with NId \"ReleasedEquipment\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n8. if the execution of the command UpdateTaskParameter succeed, if nor error 11705 is returned.","FullInfo":"The command will release the allocated Equipment related to this task.\r\nThe command performs the folllowing checks:\r\n1. if the given Task exist, if not error 11613 is returned;\r\n2. if the Work Order Context related to the Task exists, if not error 11700 is returned;\r\n3. if the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n4. if the value of the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" is not empty, if not error 11711 is returned;\r\n5. if the piece of Equipment identify by the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" exists, if not error 11706 is returned;\r\n6. if the execution of the command ReleaseEquipment succeed, if not error 11710 is returned;\r\n7. if the Task Parameter with NId \"ReleasedEquipment\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n8. if the execution of the command UpdateTaskParameter succeed, if nor error 11705 is returned.","InfoMap":{"$id":"393","FullIdObj":{"$id":"394","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"The command will release the allocated Equipment related to this task.\r\nThe command performs the folllowing checks:\r\n1. if the given Task exist, if not error 11613 is returned;\r\n2. if the Work Order Context related to the Task exists, if not error 11700 is returned;\r\n3. if the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n4. if the value of the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" is not empty, if not error 11711 is returned;\r\n5. if the piece of Equipment identify by the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" exists, if not error 11706 is returned;\r\n6. if the execution of the command ReleaseEquipment succeed, if not error 11710 is returned;\r\n7. if the Task Parameter with NId \"ReleasedEquipment\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n8. if the execution of the command UpdateTaskParameter succeed, if nor error 11705 is returned.","FullInfo":"The command will release the allocated Equipment related to this task.\r\nThe command performs the folllowing checks:\r\n1. if the given Task exist, if not error 11613 is returned;\r\n2. if the Work Order Context related to the Task exists, if not error 11700 is returned;\r\n3. if the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n4. if the value of the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" is not empty, if not error 11711 is returned;\r\n5. if the piece of Equipment identify by the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" exists, if not error 11706 is returned;\r\n6. if the execution of the command ReleaseEquipment succeed, if not error 11710 is returned;\r\n7. if the Task Parameter with NId \"ReleasedEquipment\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n8. if the execution of the command UpdateTaskParameter succeed, if nor error 11705 is returned.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"394"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"The command will release the allocated Equipment related to this task.\r\nThe command performs the folllowing checks:\r\n1. if the given Task exist, if not error 11613 is returned;\r\n2. if the Work Order Context related to the Task exists, if not error 11700 is returned;\r\n3. if the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n4. if the value of the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" is not empty, if not error 11711 is returned;\r\n5. if the piece of Equipment identify by the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" exists, if not error 11706 is returned;\r\n6. if the execution of the command ReleaseEquipment succeed, if not error 11710 is returned;\r\n7. if the Task Parameter with NId \"ReleasedEquipment\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n8. if the execution of the command UpdateTaskParameter succeed, if nor error 11705 is returned.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"The command will release the allocated Equipment related to this task.\r\nThe command performs the folllowing checks:\r\n1. if the given Task exist, if not error 11613 is returned;\r\n2. if the Work Order Context related to the Task exists, if not error 11700 is returned;\r\n3. if the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n4. if the value of the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" is not empty, if not error 11711 is returned;\r\n5. if the piece of Equipment identify by the Task Parameter with NId \"EquipmentToRelease\" exists, if not error 11706 is returned;\r\n6. if the execution of the command ReleaseEquipment succeed, if not error 11710 is returned;\r\n7. if the Task Parameter with NId \"ReleasedEquipment\" exists, if not error 11702 is returned;\r\n8. if the execution of the command UpdateTaskParameter succeed, if nor error 11705 is returned."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"395","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"204"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"396","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(9c3e877e-fb58-462c-a4e4-6d820cb3d7e2)","FullInfo":"@Guid(9c3e877e-fb58-462c-a4e4-6d820cb3d7e2)","InfoMap":{"$id":"397","FullIdObj":{"$id":"398","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(9c3e877e-fb58-462c-a4e4-6d820cb3d7e2)","FullInfo":"@Guid(9c3e877e-fb58-462c-a4e4-6d820cb3d7e2)","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"398"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"204"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@Guid(9c3e877e-fb58-462c-a4e4-6d820cb3d7e2)","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@Guid(9c3e877e-fb58-462c-a4e4-6d820cb3d7e2)"}],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"ReleaseEquipmentFromTask","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"ReleaseEquipmentFromTask"},{"$id":"399","$type":"DslCommandInputDeclarationTree","Children":[{"$id":"400","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"WITH","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"204"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"WITH","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"WITH"},{"$id":"401","$type":"DslCommandPropertyCollectionTree","Name":"InputProperties","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"204"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"ChildrenLis